iqi:p004","text":"孝景四年，立栗太子，使魏其侯為太子傅。孝景七年，栗太子廢，魏其數爭不能得。魏其謝病，屏居藍田南山之下數月，諸賓客辯士說之，莫能來。梁人高遂乃說魏其曰：「能富貴將軍者，上也；能親將軍者，太后也。今將軍傅太子，太子廢而不能爭；爭不能得，又弗能死。自引謝病，擁趙女，屏閒處而不朝。相提而論，是自明揚主上之過。有如兩宮螫將軍，則妻子毋類矣。」魏其侯然之，乃遂起，朝請如故。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"栗太子","kind":"person","person_id":"sug_498_fdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"魏其侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"栗太子","kind":"person","person_id":"sug_498_fdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"高遂","kind":"person","person_id":"rjr_guv_fre","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"趙女","kind":"person","person_id":"zgm_3w8_12c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m004-0167","start":167,"end":170,"surface":"魏其侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p005","text":"桃侯免相，竇太后數言魏其侯。孝景帝曰：「太后豈以為臣有愛，不相魏其？魏其者，沾沾自喜耳，多易。難以為相，持重。」遂不用，用建陵侯衛綰為丞相。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"桃侯","kind":"person","person_id":"xwe_h0r_1x4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_mjw_rwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"魏其侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m005-0061","start":61,"end":66,"surface":"建陵侯衛綰","kind":"person","person_id":"ee1_qga_8bw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p006","text":"武安侯田蚡者，孝景后同母弟也，生長陵。魏其已為大將軍後，方盛，蚡為諸郎，未貴，往來侍酒魏其，跪起如子姓。及孝景晚節，蚡益貴幸，為太中大夫。蚡辯有口，學槃盂諸書，王太后賢之。孝景崩，即日太子立，稱制，所鎮撫多有田蚡賓客計筴，蚡弟田勝，皆以太后弟，孝景後三年封蚡為武安侯，勝為周陽侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"武安侯田蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"孝景后","kind":"person","person_id":"5u3_i3p_ngq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"王太后","kind":"person","person_id":"5u3_i3p_ngq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"田蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"田勝","kind":"person","person_id":"s1l_mqa_s2c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0130","start":130,"end":133,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"s1l_mqa_s2c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m006-0136","start":136,"end":139,"surface":"周陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"s1l_mqa_s2c","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p013","text":"潁陰侯言之上，上以夫為中郎將。數月，坐法去。後家居長安，長安中諸公莫弗稱之。孝景時，至代相。孝景崩，今上初即位，以為淮陽天下交，勁兵處，故徙夫為淮陽太守。建元元年，入為太仆。二年，夫與長樂衛尉竇甫飲，輕重不得，夫醉，搏甫。甫，竇太后昆弟也。上恐太后誅夫，徙為燕相。數歲，坐法去官，家居長安。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"d4q_icw_co6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"竇甫","kind":"person","person_id":"nau_948_2gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"甫","kind":"person","person_id":"nau_948_2gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"甫","kind":"person","person_id":"nau_948_2gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0113","start":113,"end":116,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_mjw_rwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_mjw_rwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p024","text":"於是上使御史簿責魏其所言灌夫，頗不讎，欺謾。劾系都司空。孝景時，魏其常受遺詔，曰「事有不便，以便宜論上」。及系，灌夫罪至族，事日急，諸公莫敢複明言於上。魏其乃使昆弟子上書言之，幸得複召見。書奏上，而案尚書大行無遺詔。詔書獨藏魏其家，家丞封。乃劾魏其矯先帝詔，罪當棄市。五年十月，悉論灌夫及家屬。魏其良久乃聞，聞即恚，病痱，不食欲死。或聞上無意殺魏其，魏其複食，治病，議定不死矣。乃有蜚語為惡言聞上，故以十二月晦論棄市渭城。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m024-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m024-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"灌夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m024-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m024-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m024-0056"